# Tirisfal Glades - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde-block Tirisfal route: every Tirisfal Glades accept in the local
# census (109 quests, docs/tirisfal-glades-census.md) appears exactly once
# as an accept and once as a turnin. Band 1-13 by minLevel cluster (zone key
# 1420, order 48). Undercity accepts (key 1458) are city quests and stay out.
# No race header: the zone serves all Horde, and the Undead race bits the data
# carries are the home-zone default, not exclusivity - per-line `only` gates
# carry class only (Warrior, Rogue, Priest, Mage, Warlock, Paladin lines).
# Soft-pre notes stand on the three IN quests with out-of-contract pres
# (409 needs Silverpine 366; 441 needs Silverpine 440; 94436 needs city
# 94435) - the sim reads them as structural warnings, never wedges.
# Item-starts ride the bag-note pattern (361's letter, 95328's residue).
# Expedition legs switch frames deliberately and back: Silverpine (1421,
# Renferrel takes 445) and Undercity (1458, nine turn-ins).
guide butler-routes-completionist/tirisfal-glades
title Tirisfal Glades
levels 1-13
zone Tirisfal Glades
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Deathknell - arrival in the shadow

  zone map 1420


  note Deathknell works the Rude Awakening line, the crypt scrolls, the paladin drills and the Arren chain - all within a minute of the coffin.

